name: All Agent MCP
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/Oryn/sca/all-agent-mcp/icon.svg
version: 2.0.38
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Lets any MCP-capable AI agent (Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Copilot and more) drive the editor through a free self-hosted relay Worker. Version 2 adds a dedicated Agents card with five windows: Agent List (named agents with brand icons, 5-digit IDs, approve / kick), Agent Chat (chat, Agent Board and a Manage tab to mute agents and wipe chat or board; chat and board can float), Agent History, Agent Permissions (per agent) and Agent Configurations. New agents can be set to need your approval, fake agents from probes no longer appear, and every window follows light and dark mode. The top banner disappears when the master switch is off. Version 2.0.2: every editor toast reaches agents as it is shown (plus toasts / toast_log to look back), agents can export the document as a file (pdf, scd, uscd, docx, txt, md, jpg, png, webp), use Color Labs (color), scroll / pan / drag, send images and files (insert_image, upload_file), right-click and use context menus, run Document Quality (quality), and the Help Guide now opens as a proper modal. Version 2.0.3 adds batch, find_ui, read_page, read_selection, list_pages, select_text, open_dialog, fill_form, checkpoint, revert and import_document (empty documents only). Re-deploy your relay Worker for toasts and files. Open the built-in guide with /guide. Version 2.0.5 adds page setup commands (paginationset, pagelayoutset, pageorientset, pagesizeset, pagesizereset). Version 2.0.6 to 2.0.8 add inserts for video, audio, map, graph, geometry, mind map, text box, LaTeX, QR code and barcode. Version 2.0.9 adds in-editor translation (translate, translatestatus, translatecancel, translateusage). Version 2.0.10 refreshes the guide for all of these. Version 2.0.11 adds insertdatetime and datetimeformats. Version 2.0.12 adds insertchart. Version 2.0.13 adds insertbanner. Version 2.0.14 adds insertshape and shapelist. Version 2.0.15 fixes the add-on file so the script address is clean. Version 2.0.16 adds selectall, paragraphstyle, paragraphstylelist, removeparagraphstyle and formatpainter. Version 2.0.17 adds grammarcheck, grammarissues, grammarfix, spellissues, spellfix and wordprediction. Version 2.0.18 adds iconlibs, iconsearch, inserticon, formfieldtypes and insertformfield. Version 2.0.19 adds opendraw, closedraw, esignfonts, insertsignature, openesign and closeesign. Version 2.0.20 adds bgsolid, bggradient, bgstatus, pagenumberstyle, pagenumberstatus, headerstyle, footerstyle and themepanel, and bgset now switches to a gradient when given two colors. Version 2.0.21 adds viewlayout, editormode, viewstatus, pagescaling, viewpreview and wordgoal. Version 2.0.22 adds insertpage, movepage, duplicatepages, removepages, overlappingpages and pagenavigator. Version 2.0.23 adds slides, slidesstatus, slidesnav, slidestool, slidesundo, slidesredo, slidesclear, slidesplay, slidesthumbs and slideszoom. Version 2.0.24 adds inktrace, inktracestatus, inktracesettings and inktracepanel. Version 2.0.25 adds summarize, askdocument, placeholders, placeholderadd, placeholderremove, assistivewriting, expandoptions, echo and echoclear. Version 2.0.26 adds snippetadd, snippets, snippetgo, snippetremove, snippetsdone, snippetscopy, margindesign, margindesignlist, margindesignadd, margindesigns, margindesigncolor, margindesignremove and margindesignclear. Version 2.0.27 adds images, imageset, imagemove, imagelock, imageremove, banners, bannerset, bannerlock and bannerremove. Version 2.0.28 adds lists, listbullet and listnumber. Version 2.0.29 adds links, linkset, linkremove and linkbutton. Version 2.0.30 adds tablestyle, tableborder and tablecellstyle. Version 2.0.31 fixes a loading error that came with 2.0.30. Version 2.0.32 adds formfields, formfieldset, formfieldlock and formfieldremove. Version 2.0.33 adds shapes and shapeset. Version 2.0.34 adds export, exportoptions and exportoption. Version 2.0.35 adds imagecrop. Version 2.0.36 adds sidebar. Version 2.0.37 adds hrs, hrset, hrmove and hrremove. Version 2.0.38 adds latexformulas, latexset, latexremove, textboxes, textboxset, textboxlock and textboxremove.
p/html:
p/css: https://mahi902.github.io/Oryn/sca/all-agent-mcp/all-agent-mcp.css
p/js: https://mahi902.github.io/Oryn/sca/all-agent-mcp/all-agent-mcp.js
